---
import SectionHead from './SectionHead.astro';
---

<section id="play" class="relative scroll-mt-24 py-24 md:py-36">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1400px] px-5 md:px-10">
    <SectionHead index="05" label="Off the clock" />

    <p
      class="font-display max-w-4xl text-4xl leading-[1.05] font-bold tracking-tight uppercase sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl"
      data-words
    >
      Strategy doesn't stop at <span class="text-volt">6&nbsp;PM.</span>
    </p>

    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-5 md:mt-20 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <!-- boardgames -->
      <article
        class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-line bg-navy p-8 transition-colors duration-400 hover:border-volt/50 md:p-12"
        data-reveal
      >
        <span
          class="font-display pointer-events-none absolute -top-8 -right-2 text-[8rem] font-bold tracking-tight text-ink/5 uppercase transition-colors duration-400 select-none group-hover:text-volt/10 md:text-[10rem]"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          Play
        </span>

        <div class="meeple relative mb-8 h-20 w-20 text-volt md:h-24 md:w-24">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="h-full w-full">
            <path
              d="M50 8c9 0 15 7 15 15 0 5-2 9-5 12 3 1 6 3 10 6 6 5 14 7 20 8 4 1 6 4 6 8v6c0 3-2 5-5 5H70c1 8 5 14 9 19 2 3 0 7-4 7H55c-2 0-4-1-5-3-1 2-3 3-5 3H25c-4 0-6-4-4-7 4-5 8-11 9-19H9c-3 0-5-2-5-5v-6c0-4 2-7 6-8 6-1 14-3 20-8 4-3 7-5 10-6-3-3-5-7-5-12 0-8 6-15 15-15Z"
            ></path>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <h3 class="font-display relative text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight uppercase md:text-3xl">
          Tabletop general
        </h3>
        <p class="relative mt-4 max-w-lg text-base leading-relaxed text-mute md:text-lg">
          Give me a heavy euro and a table of friends and I'm gone for the evening. Board games are
          strategy practice disguised as fun — resource trade-offs, positioning, reading people.
          Sound familiar? That's branding.
        </p>
        <ul class="relative mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          {
            ['Heavy euros', 'Worker placement', 'One more turn'].map((t) => (
              <li class="font-display rounded-full border border-line px-3 py-1 text-[11px] tracking-[0.14em] text-mute uppercase transition-colors group-hover:border-volt/40 group-hover:text-ink">
                {t}
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>
      </article>

      <!-- basketball -->
      <article
        class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-line bg-navy p-8 transition-colors duration-400 hover:border-volt/50 md:p-12"
        data-reveal
        style="--d:.12s"
      >
        <span
          class="font-display pointer-events-none absolute -top-8 -right-2 text-[8rem] font-bold tracking-tight text-ink/5 uppercase transition-colors duration-400 select-none group-hover:text-volt/10 md:text-[10rem]"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          Hoop
        </span>

        <div class="ball relative mb-8 h-20 w-20 text-volt md:h-24 md:w-24">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="5" aria-hidden="true" class="h-full w-full">
            <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="42"></circle>
            <path d="M50 8v84M8 50h84M20 19c8 8 13 19 13 31s-5 23-13 31M80 19c-8 8-13 19-13 31s5 23 13 31"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <h3 class="font-display relative text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight uppercase md:text-3xl">
          Court vision
        </h3>
        <p class="relative mt-4 max-w-lg text-base leading-relaxed text-mute md:text-lg">
          Most ideas get unstuck on the court, somewhere between a pick-and-roll and a badly missed
          three. Basketball keeps my eyes sharp, my legs honest and my ego thoroughly in check.
        </p>
        <ul class="relative mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          {
            ['Pick-up games', 'Pick-and-roll', 'Cardio with a scoreboard'].map((t) => (
              <li class="font-display rounded-full border border-line px-3 py-1 text-[11px] tracking-[0.14em] text-mute uppercase transition-colors group-hover:border-volt/40 group-hover:text-ink">
                {t}
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @media (hover: hover) and (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .group:hover .meeple {
      animation: meeple-wiggle 0.9s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .group:hover .ball {
      animation: ball-bounce 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.3, 0, 0.4, 1) infinite;
    }
  }

  @keyframes meeple-wiggle {
    0%,
    100% {
      transform: rotate(-7deg);
    }
    50% {
      transform: rotate(7deg);
    }
  }

  @keyframes ball-bounce {
    0%,
    100% {
      transform: translateY(0) scale(1, 1);
    }
    18% {
      transform: translateY(2px) scale(1.06, 0.92);
    }
    55% {
      transform: translateY(-16px) scale(0.97, 1.03);
    }
  }
</style>
